<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:41:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>《龙与地下城》冠军赛季今天早些时候拉开序幕，并提供《魔兽世界》实战体验</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-season-of-champions-kicks-off-early-today-with-world-of-warcraft-liveplay/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《龙与地下城》粉丝可以在新的《地下城大师》活动中抢先体验即将推出的《魔兽世界》游戏扩展包。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-season-of-champions-kicks-off-early-today-with-world-of-warcraft-liveplay/"&gt;《龙与地下城》后的冠军赛季今天早些时候开始，《魔兽世界》实战游戏&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:29:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-season-of-champions-kicks-off-early-today-with-world-of-warcraft-liveplay/</guid></item><item><title>一名男子从树上掉下来并落在她身上后，比生活更响亮的与会者瘫痪了</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/louder-than-life-attendee-left-paralyzed-after-a-man-fell-out-of-a-tree-and-landed-on-her/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在 2026 年 Louder Than Life 音乐节上，一名男子从树上掉下来砸在了一名女子身上，导致她瘫痪。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/louder-than-life-attendee-left-paralyzed-after-a-man-fell-out-of-a-tree-and-landed-on-her/"&gt;一名男子从树上掉下来砸到她身上后，《Louder Than Life》的参与者瘫痪了，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:20:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/louder-than-life-attendee-left-paralyzed-after-a-man-fell-out-of-a-tree-and-landed-on-her/</guid></item><item><title>Bring Me the Horizo​​n 在他们价值 80 美元的 VIP 音乐会套餐中向他们嘲笑做同样事情的摇滚歌手“道歉”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/bring-me-the-horizon-poke-fun-at-their-80-vip-concert-package-by-offering-apology-to-rock-singer-they-mocked-for-doing-the-same-thing/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Bring Me The Horizo​​n 刚刚推出了 80 美元的音乐会 VIP 套餐，这个价格与奥利·赛克斯 (Oli Sykes) 嘲笑一位摇滚歌手出售自己的门票的价格相同。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这篇文章&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/bring-me-the-horizon-poke-fun-at-their-80-vip-concert-package-by-offering-apology-to-rock-singer-they-mocked-for-doing-the-same-thing/"&gt;《Bring Me the Horizo​​n》在他们价值 80 美元的 VIP 音乐会套餐中向他们因做同样的事情而嘲笑的摇滚歌手提供“道歉”来取笑，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:17:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/bring-me-the-horizon-poke-fun-at-their-80-vip-concert-package-by-offering-apology-to-rock-singer-they-mocked-for-doing-the-same-thing/</guid></item><item><title>Shift Up 应对 Stellar Blade Switch 2 演示性能的强烈反对</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/stellar-blade-switch-2-demo-frame-generation-toggle/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Shift Up 已回应有关 Stellar Blade Switch 2 演示版性能的投诉。据该工作室称，玩家将能够在发布时关闭帧生成，为他们提供游戏外观和感觉的另一种选择。 Shift Up 回应 Stellar Blade Switch 2 演示问题 Stellar Blade Switch 2 […]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/stellar-blade-switch-2-demo-frame-generation-toggle/"&gt;Shift Up 响应 Stellar Blade Switch 2 演示性能反弹&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:09:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/stellar-blade-switch-2-demo-frame-generation-toggle/</guid></item><item><title>我们所知道的关于“Looksmaxxing”影响者锁骨强奸指控的一切</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/everything-we-know-about-the-rape-charges-against-looksmaxxing-influencer-clavicular/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;布雷登·彼得斯 (Braden Peters)，又名“锁骨”(Clavular)，是一位影响者，他推广了“lookmaxking”和“mogging”等令人讨厌的术语，他被指控强奸一名 17 岁女孩。据称，他给她喝了太多酒，并在她无法同意的情况下与她发生了性关系。这位 20 岁的互联网名人在他短暂的任期内取得了相当大的成就 [...]&